{"id":"b768b53c62ab02de","group":"88","path":"88/88-df-term.md","title":"Term","display":"df-term — Term","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Computability and Logic","book_abbrev":"88","label":"88-df-term","aliases":["88-df-term"],"display":"df-term — Term","depends_on":["[[88-df-symbol]]","[[88-df-language]]","[[88-df-variable]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Computability and Logic"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"88"},{"key":"label","html":"88-df-term"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>88-df-term</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-term — Term"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"0f1e525f3e037509\" href=\"?note=0f1e525f3e037509\" title=\"88-df-symbol\">88-df-symbol</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"99f4e6abf02e07ae\" href=\"?note=99f4e6abf02e07ae\" title=\"88-df-language\">88-df-language</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"8fb998e5ff14bea3\" href=\"?note=8fb998e5ff14bea3\" title=\"88-df-variable\">88-df-variable</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> (first-order signature, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"99f4e6abf02e07ae\" href=\"?note=99f4e6abf02e07ae\" title=\"88-df-language\">88-df-language</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Const}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Const}_S\\)</span> (constant-symbol class, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"0f1e525f3e037509\" href=\"?note=0f1e525f3e037509\" title=\"88-df-symbol\">88-df-symbol</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Var}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Var}_S\\)</span> (variable set, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"8fb998e5ff14bea3\" href=\"?note=8fb998e5ff14bea3\" title=\"88-df-variable\">88-df-variable</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Func}_S^n\">\\(\\mathrm{Func}_S^n\\)</span> (n-ary function-symbol class, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"0f1e525f3e037509\" href=\"?note=0f1e525f3e037509\" title=\"88-df-symbol\">88-df-symbol</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Term}_S^{(d)}\">\\(\\mathrm{Term}_S^{(d)}\\)</span> (terms of construction depth at most <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d\">\\(d\\)</span>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Term}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Term}_S\\)</span> (term set)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}term} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{Term}_S^{(0)}\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Const}_S\\cup\\mathrm{Var}_S\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}term} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{Term}_S^{(0)}\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Const}_S\\cup\\mathrm{Var}_S\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}term} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{Term}_S^{(d+1)}\\coloneqq\n\\mathrm{Term}_S^{(d)}\n\\cup\\bigcup_{n\\geq1}\n\\bigl\\{f(t_1,\\ldots,t_n):\nf\\in\\mathrm{Func}_S^n\\land\n(t_1,\\ldots,t_n)\\in(\\mathrm{Term}_S^{(d)})^n\n\\bigr\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}term} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{Term}_S^{(d+1)}\\coloneqq\n\\mathrm{Term}_S^{(d)}\n\\cup\\bigcup_{n\\geq1}\n\\bigl\\{f(t_1,\\ldots,t_n):\nf\\in\\mathrm{Func}_S^n\\land\n(t_1,\\ldots,t_n)\\in(\\mathrm{Term}_S^{(d)})^n\n\\bigr\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}term} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{Term}_S\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{d\\in\\mathbb N}\\mathrm{Term}_S^{(d)}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}term} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{Term}_S\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{d\\in\\mathbb N}\\mathrm{Term}_S^{(d)}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>三个等式以自然数递归给出有限语法树的唯一分层；每个项恰在某个有限\n深度出现，不再对一个未给定承载类中的“所有闭包候选”取交。</li>\n<li>常量项：如 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0, a, b\">\\(0, a, b\\)</span> —— 直接命名对象</li>\n<li>变量项：如 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x, y, z\">\\(x, y, z\\)</span> —— 在赋值下命名对象</li>\n<li>复合项：如 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S(0), +(x, y)\">\\(S(0), +(x, y)\\)</span> —— 通过函数构造对象</li>\n</ul>\n<p>例子（Peano算术）：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\">\\(0\\)</span>（常量项）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span>（变量项）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S(0)\">\\(S(0)\\)</span>（后继项）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"+(S(0), S(S(0)))\">\\(+(S(0), S(S(0)))\\)</span>（加法项）</li>\n</ul>\n<p>性质：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>所有项都不含逻辑联结词或量词</li>\n<li>项可以包含变量，但不含约束量词</li>\n</ul>\n<p>相关概念：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"e14624569ca2194b\" href=\"?note=e14624569ca2194b\" title=\"88-df-formula\">88-df-formula</a>：由项和谓词构成的表达式</li>\n<li><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"13ac48daafe6d04f\" href=\"?note=13ac48daafe6d04f\" title=\"88-df-sentence\">88-df-sentence</a>：不含自由变量的公式</li>\n<li><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"b642ab331635c77d\" href=\"?note=b642ab331635c77d\" title=\"88-df-free-variable\">88-df-free-variable</a>：项中可能出现的变量</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"88-df-symbol","status":"resolved","id":"0f1e525f3e037509","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":""